    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26bd Soccer Field PRO 3D</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soccer Field PRO 3D</strong> delivers an intense football experience with realistic physics, multiplayer matches, and full creative freedom. Build your team, pull off amazing dribbles, customize your players, and hit the field for fast-paced, competitive gameplay!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Game Highlights:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Smooth gameplay with responsive controls and precise action<br>\u2699\ufe0f Full customization of players and teams<br>\ud83d\udd04 Realistic ball physics, passing, and movement<br>\ud83d\udcda Interactive tutorial to get you started fast<br>\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Create your own room and play with friends<br>\ud83c\udf10 Real-time online multiplayer mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a scoring machine, a legendary goalkeeper, or the ultimate match host. <strong>Soccer Field PRO 3D</strong> is free to play, competitive, and addictive!</p>",
